      "id": "claim_3539b618d483402688a92f39866dba9e",
      "statement": "ToolchainManager collects executable seeds from four ordered sources — user-selected custom tools (rank 0), system discovery (PATH plus known install locations like bun-home, fnm, mise shims, scoop), bundled ripgrep/fd from app resources, and previously installed managed runtimes — with DiscoveryRegistry handling platform-specific layouts.",
